SourceCode.Declaration:
/// <summary>
/// One piece of unsent work saved from a device (HSMobileOpsDeviceWork). Payload is the app's own JSON for it.
/// </summary>
[DataContractAttribute]
class HSMobileOpsDeviceWorkRow
{
    str        workKey;
    str        deviceId;
    str        userName;
    str        warehouseId;
    str        kind;
    str        reference;
    str        summary;
    int        lineCount;
    int64      capturedMs;
    str        updatedUtc;
    str        appVersion;
    str        payload;
}

Method.Source:
